    "specifications": "- **Payment Method Identification**: Route all payments through 'Pe Pulse Private Limited' as the primary bank/payment ledger.\n- **Granular Classification**: Deconstruct broad categories like 'Office expenses' into specific accounting buckets: Refrigerator goes to Capital/Fixed Assets (Office Equipment), Stationery to Printing & Stationery, Rent and Parking to Rent & Conveyance, and Electricity to Utilities/Power Expenses.\n- **Salary Processing**: Book 'Salary' expenses against specific employees (Sonam, Tausif Shaikha, Anand Sharma, Chandrakant Parte, Bony Kuchikorve) to support payroll reconciliation.\n- **Daily Allowances (DA)**: Account for individual travel/daily allowances separately from main salary ledgers for better field-expense auditing.\n- **Lease & Machinery Rental**: Map 'Natrox Rent' and 'Natrox machin' payments to Machinery Rental / Equipment Lease Expenses rather than standard office space rent.",
